    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐποικοδομ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build up,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσαντας αὐτὸ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τεῖχος</span>) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψηλότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.5.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				55.25
			</span></i> : metaph., <i>pile up, use a climax,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1365a16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1426b3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>build upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κρηπῖδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.4.11
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κρηπῖδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					736e
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοὺς τοίχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					483.117
				</span></i>
			 (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>) : metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				793c
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσει μαθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.610
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ εὐτονίαν, ἀσφάλειαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.15.8
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ θεμέλιον</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεμελίῳ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				2.20
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεμελίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.47
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀληθέσιν ἐψευσμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					8.2.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				87
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>edify,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτοὺς τῇ πίστει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Jud.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ούμενοι ἐν Χριστῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Col.</u>
					2.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτειχίζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.46.5
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατόπεδα πέντε -ησάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					2.1.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
